{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1785112598, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": null}, "title": "TraceMind — Composition wedge (memory_context_for)"}
[0.011278, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m▸ The problem\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mYou're mid-thread in Claude Code, need to reference last week's browsing / decisions / open commitments on a topic. Today: paste-hunt across tabs. Wedge: one MCP verb, memory_context_for(topic), returns a cited paragraph you can inject in the current chat.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.018994, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m▸ Seed a realistic local memory\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mSimulated week of browsing on 'World Cup 2026', one Commitment ('will buy Group Stage tickets'), plus a triple that will contradict a later belief so the retraction beat has something to say.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.030286, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ tracemind ingest \"https://www.fifa.com/tickets FIFA World Cup 2026 Tickets\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.974688, "o", "Ingested: \"https://www.fifa.com/tickets FIFA World Cup 2026 Tickets\"\r\n  Trace:    eb095995-b24a-484f-920f-5b3882a57d8b\r\n  Entities: 4\r\n    [Url] https://www.fifa.com/tickets\r\n    [Organization] fifa.com\r\n    [Event] FIFA World Cup 2026\r\n"]
[4.974922, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ tracemind ingest \"https://apnews.com/article/world-cup-2026-tickets Ticket resale prices for the 2026 World Cup\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.631057, "o", "Ingested: \"https://apnews.com/article/world-cup-2026-tickets Ticket resale prices for the 2...\"\r\n  Trace:    35c20edc-bebf-4f3a-9af7-d8f11936d053\r\n  Entities: 3\r\n    [Url] https://apnews.com/article/world-cup-2026-tickets\r\n    [Organization] apnews.com\r\n    [Event] World Cup\r\n"]
