[6.281155, "o", "Ingested: \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_FIFA_World_Cup 2026 FIFA World Cup — Wikipe...\"\r\n  Trace:    73a59c1a-6c5b-464e-8f07-7c2368a08a40\r\n  Entities: 3\r\n    [Url] https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_FIFA_World_Cup\r\n    [Organization] en.wikipedia.org\r\n    [Event] FIFA World Cup\r\n"]
