[30.789429, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m▸ Grounding is honest\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mAsk for a topic memory doesn't know about — the brief says so, the host can abstain instead of hallucinating.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
