[36.98771, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m▸ Wrap\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mOne primitive — memory_context_for(topic, budget) — turns any MCP host into a context-aware surface for your local memory. No copy-paste, no chrome, no cloud. That is the composition wedge.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
